Hello, denizens of Limbo! 

We're thrilled to share some exciting news: [b]Kulebra and the Souls of Limbo is set to launch on May 16, 2025![/b]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44619688/7b2148cadf459b9a13661fef2cca7eb16eee4b07.gif[/img]

This charming adventure invites you to explore the world of Limbo, a vibrant Latin American-styled afterlife with a dark mystery. There’s a strange curse in Limbo that is keeping the souls who live there trapped in a never-ending 24-hour time loop. 

As Kulebra, a dead snake of unknown origin, you’ll explore this beautiful papercraft world filled with unforgettable characters, each with their own stories and mysteries to solve. Use your wits, kindness, and maybe a good whack to gather clues, items, and evidence that will help break the mysterious curse of Limbo and help its residents move on once and for all! 💛

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44619688/1f6f2c37129ca1417836f853243093c17c7ad511.gif[/img]

Created by brothers Paulo and Pavel Lara, who started their game development journey in the Dominican Republic, Kulebra and the Souls of Limbo is a labor of love that blends Latin American cultural influences with heartfelt storytelling 🇩🇴💌

Ready to embark on this whimsical afterlife adventure now? A free demo is available now - pick it up to prepare to explore the enchanting world of Limbo on May 16 📅

